    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107386" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρδεινος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exceedingly alarming</i>
			or <i>dangerous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πρᾶγμα εἰς ὑπέρδεινόν μοι περιέστη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.111
				</span></i>
			; <i>very hard,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>very able,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥήτωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					4.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. εἰπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					46.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
